<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="23"><font face="Hira v8"><font color="#eb3534">because they want to change something</font></font></font></b></font>

44
00:01:31,070 --> 00:01:34,990
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Friend!</font>

45
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?!</font>

46
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:40,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean to say that only rookies
went after Sasuke?!</font>

47
00:01:41,580 --> 00:01:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It really couldn't be helped...</font>

48
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the situation in
the Village being how it is...</font>

49
00:01:51,990 --> 00:01:53,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And anyway...</font>

50
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've taken the minimally
required measures.</font>

51
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey!</font>

52
00:02:02,770 --> 00:02:05,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your mission has already
been assigned!</font>

53
00:02:05,780 --> 00:02:08,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, I'm gonna go do an errand
and will be back shortly...</font>

54
00:02:08,790 --> 00:02:10,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry.</font>

55
00:02:16,190 --> 00:02:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez...</font>

56
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

57
00:02:25,860 --> 00:02:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

58
00:02:27,530 --> 00:02:32,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's already been two days
since Sasuke-kun left the village...</font>

59
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:35,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Naruto and the others who went in
pursuit haven't come back either.</font>

60
00:02:36,290 --> 00:02:37,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And neither has Lee-san...</font>

61
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:41,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know. I've more or less
heard the whole story.</font>

62
00:02:42,650 --> 00:02:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... believe in Naruto!</font>

63
00:02:47,430 --> 00:02:50,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe him, but if something were
to happen to Naruto and Sasuke-kun...</font>

64
00:02:54,850 --> 00:02:57,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura, you don't need to
worry about anything.</font>

65
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave this to me.</font>

66
00:03:17,210 --> 00:03:18,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

67
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First of all, I want you guys to
fan out in all directions</font>

68
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:34,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in pursuit of Naruto
and Sasuke's scent.</font>

69
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:37,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and Sasuke you said?</font>

70
00:03:38,850 --> 00:03:40,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did something happen
to the two of them?</font>

71
00:03:41,270 --> 00:03:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll explain later...
Right now, time is of essence.</font>

72
00:03:45,590 --> 00:03:46,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

73
00:03:47,490 --> 00:03:49,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As soon as you confirm that
you've detected the scent,</font>

74
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:51,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">call me and I'll be there immediately.</font>

75
00:03:52,620 --> 00:03:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Scatter!</font>

76
00:04:03,990 --> 00:04:08,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess since she saw them
fight before her very eyes...</font>

77
00:04:08,770 --> 00:04:10,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's useless to tell her
not to worry.</font>

78
00:04:17,570 --> 00:04:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

79
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

80
00:04:24,790 --> 00:04:26,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stop...</font>

81
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:49,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... Stop with revenge.</font>

82
00:04:49,770 --> 00:04:50,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

83
00:04:51,890 --> 00:04:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you were successful
in carrying out your revenge,</font>

84
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:55,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all that will come out of it
is a sense of emptiness.</font>

85
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:57,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

86
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you know?!</font>

87
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:02,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that so knowingly!</font>

88
00:05:02,570 --> 00:05:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... calm down.</font>

89
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neither you nor I could
call ourselves lucky.</font>

90
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of that much I'm certain.</font>

91
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it could be worse.</font>

92
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both you and I have found
precious comrades, right?</font>

93
00:05:23,770 --> 00:05:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We understand that all the more
because we've lost them once.</font>

94
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:27,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I taught you Chidori</font>

95
00:05:28,310 --> 00:05:31,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because you now have
precious people.</font>

96
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:37,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That power isn't something to be used
against your comrades or for revenge.</font>

97
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:41,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know what that power
should be used for.</font>

98
00:05:42,190 --> 00:05:43,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna win no matter what!</font>

99
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:45,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get so carried away!</font>

100
00:05:47,770 --> 00:05:49,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was too naive...</font>

101
00:05:50,790 --> 00:05:53,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Watching them, they might actually
be intent on killing each other...</font>

102
00:06:04,830 --> 00:06:05,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei...</font>

103
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:13,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please let me get there
in time!</font>

104
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already said this earlier but...</font>

105
00:06:32,230 --> 00:06:34,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In truth, you were waiting
for this too, weren't you?</font>

106
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:38,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neither Kakashi nor Sakura
are present right now.</font>

107
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:43,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So there's nobody here to stop us
like that time before.</font>

108
00:06:44,210 --> 00:06:45,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...!</font>

109
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:50,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time around we're gonna
settle this for real!</font>

110
00:06:52,450 --> 00:06:53,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will take you down!</font>

111
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chidori!</font>

112
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot...</font>

113
00:07:14,410 --> 00:07:18,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same here!
I'm gonna beat you senseless...</font>

114
00:07:18,660 --> 00:07:21,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and take you back home even
if I have to drag you!</font>

115
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:23,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

116
00:07:37,350 --> 00:07:38,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

117
00:08:20,690 --> 00:08:21,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wasn't meaningless...</font>

118
00:08:22,890 --> 00:08:27,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To me, you became
my closest friend.</font>

119
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:33,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke actually came out
and said that... to me...</font>

120
00:08:33,530 --> 00:08:37,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that's exactly the reason why
I wanted to verify it using this Rasengan.</font>

121
00:08:58,770 --> 00:08:59,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

122
00:09:01,820 --> 00:09:03,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you!</font>

123
00:09:24,740 --> 00:09:26,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

124
00:09:26,690 --> 00:09:28,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was able to counter</font>

125
00:09:28,750 --> 00:09:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my full power of Chidori
to that extent...</font>

126
00:09:32,970 --> 00:09:34,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That jutsu...</font>

127
00:09:46,450 --> 00:09:47,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

128
00:09:51,070 --> 00:09:54,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, to what extent...!</font>

129
00:09:57,180 --> 00:09:59,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That failure...</font>

130
00:10:06,660 --> 00:10:07,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!</font>

131
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:21,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, your limit is two blows...
that's about it.</font>

132
00:10:24,450 --> 00:10:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if I try to use more than that...</font>

133
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:28,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">what will happen?</font>

134
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:32,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The third blow won't initiate.</font>

135
00:10:33,150 --> 00:10:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember that well.</font>

136
00:10:35,810 --> 00:10:38,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you try to initiate
the Jutsu forcibly...</font>

137
00:10:38,500 --> 00:10:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not only will the Art not
initiate properly,</font>

138
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but your Chakra will become zero...</font>

139
00:10:43,100 --> 00:10:45,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the worst case scenario
it will cost you your life!</font>

140
00:10:46,950 --> 00:10:50,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... I can't waste a blow...</font>

141
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:54,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wouldn't serve any purpose
if we cancel each other like earlier.</font>

142
00:11:01,470 --> 00:11:05,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's... no longer
any mistake about this.</font>

143
00:11:12,060 --> 00:11:15,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... really intended...</font>

144
00:11:25,830 --> 00:11:27,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really intended to...</font>

145
00:11:36,730 --> 00:11:38,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...!</font>

146
00:11:43,740 --> 00:11:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will use numerous speedy techniques
and Jutsu to create an opening.</font>

147
00:11:49,810 --> 00:11:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then... I will make
a hit with Chidori.</font>

148
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...</font>

149
00:12:07,660 --> 00:12:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you know, Naruto...</font>

150
00:12:11,250 --> 00:12:15,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Top-class Ninja should be
able to read each other's hearts</font>

151
00:12:15,990 --> 00:12:18,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">simply by an exchange of fists.</font>

152
00:12:22,050 --> 00:12:25,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even without saying anything...</font>

153
00:12:30,470 --> 00:12:33,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're naive, Naruto.</font>

154
00:12:37,110 --> 00:12:38,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it?</font>

155
00:12:39,770 --> 00:12:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Were you really able
to read inside...</font>

156
00:12:43,230 --> 00:12:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this heart of mine?</font>

157
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fire Style:
Phoenix Flower Jutsu!</font>

158
00:13:11,270 --> 00:13:15,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... I knew that you
were always alone.</font>

159
00:13:17,770 --> 00:13:20,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At first, I was relieved
when I found out</font>

160
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:23,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that there was
a guy similar to myself.</font>

161
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it also made me happy...</font>

162
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:34,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To tell the truth, I really wanted
to approach you right away.</font>

163
00:13:38,290 --> 00:13:42,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... I wasn't able to approach you...</font>

164
00:13:45,630 --> 00:13:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Awesome...
— You're incredible...</font>

165
00:13:47,510 --> 00:13:49,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were always able
to do everything.</font>

166
00:13:50,510 --> 00:13:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And moreover, you were always
being praised by everyone.</font>

167
00:14:07,030 --> 00:14:10,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because you and I
were so different...</font>

168
00:14:10,990 --> 00:14:14,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I didn't want to admit it,
I decided to call you my rival.</font>

169
00:14:18,710 --> 00:14:20,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't want to lose to you...</font>

170
00:14:21,250 --> 00:14:23,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I felt that even more strongly...</font>

171
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:25,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because I was called a failure.</font>

172
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even when we were in Team 7,</font>

173
00:14:30,550 --> 00:14:32,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I continued to feel
the same way the whole time.</font>

174
00:14:33,220 --> 00:14:35,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm stubborn...</font>

175
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And wasn't able to express
what I really felt...</font>

176
00:14:42,230 --> 00:14:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What I really wanted was
to become like you.</font>

177
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:53,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were what I aspired to... so...</font>

178
00:14:55,410 --> 00:14:57,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are one of the ones I want to fight.</font>

179
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was really happy when
you said that!</font>

180
00:15:04,660 --> 00:15:09,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those were your first words...
acknowledging me...</font>

181
00:15:16,470 --> 00:15:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and I both knew,</font>

182
00:15:19,140 --> 00:15:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without us even having to
have an exchange of fists!</font>

183
00:15:22,990 --> 00:15:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From that time on...</font>

184
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even without saying anything...</font>

185
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:31,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact that...</font>

186
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:33,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we are friends!</font>

187
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not without meaning...</font>

188
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:42,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To me you're...</font>

189
00:15:44,990 --> 00:15:47,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my closest friend.</font>

190
00:15:48,550 --> 00:15:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However... you're trying to
take me down for real.</font>

191
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now, I don't really know</font>

192
00:15:55,930 --> 00:16:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">whether you really meant
what you said earlier or not.</font>

193
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:07,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thinking that we were friends...</font>

194
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:09,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That might have been...</font>

195
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That might have been just me...</font>

196
00:16:16,330 --> 00:16:18,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too late now!</font>

197
00:16:18,540 --> 00:16:19,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

198
00:16:28,210 --> 00:16:31,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case... I'm...</font>

199
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:39,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">really lame, aren't I...</font>

200
00:16:41,730 --> 00:16:43,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

201
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:00,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

202
00:17:00,740 --> 00:17:02,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped, can it?</font>

203
00:17:38,570 --> 00:17:40,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know why but...</font>

204
00:17:44,450 --> 00:17:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know why...</font>

205
00:17:47,290 --> 00:17:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I...</font>

206
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

207
00:17:59,470 --> 00:18:01,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">don't want you...</font>

208
00:18:04,520 --> 00:18:08,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you to be taken away
by someone like Orochimaru!</font>

209
00:18:25,990 --> 00:18:28,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You managed to divert it
with your left hand,</font>

210
00:18:29,370 --> 00:18:31,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it was meaningless.</font>

211
00:18:34,830 --> 00:18:37,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't be able to use
any hand sign</font>

212
00:18:37,300 --> 00:18:39,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">or that Jutsu earlier anymore.</font>

213
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:47,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the end!</font>

214
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What's...</font>

215
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that red Chakra...?</font>

216
00:19:16,210 --> 00:19:18,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where does he get that
kind of power from?!</font>

217
00:20:00,260 --> 00:20:03,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What the hell... is this?!</font>

218
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His shoulder injury is healing...</font>

219
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:14,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's unbelievable!</font>

220
00:20:45,300 --> 00:20:52,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! I'm not gonna let
Orochimaru take you away!</font>

221
00:20:55,150 --> 00:20:56,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will stop you,</font>

222
00:20:56,730 --> 00:21:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even if I have to break every bone
in your arms and legs!</font>

223
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

224
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

225
00:21:16,890 --> 00:21:23,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

226
00:21:16,890 --> 00:21:23,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

227
00:21:23,290 --> 00:21:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

228
00:21:23,290 --> 00:21:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

229
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">boku no sugu soba ni oite atta</font></font></font></font>

230
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">which I kept so close to me</font></font></font></font>

231
00:21:34,070 --> 00:21:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kotae no denai yoru to</font></font></font></font>

232
00:21:34,070 --> 00:21:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">speechless nights,</font></font></font></font>

233
00:21:39,650 --> 00:21:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a hint of warmth,</font></font></font></font>

234
00:21:39,690 --> 00:21:43,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitokira no nukumori to</font></font></font></font>

235
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">and this distant yearning for you</font></font></font></font>

236
00:21:45,450 --> 00:21:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">haruka kanata no akogare to</font></font></font></font>

237
00:21:50,870 --> 00:21:53,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I live,</font></font></font></font>

238
00:21:50,910 --> 00:21:53,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">tada sore dake wo</font></font></font></font>

239
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">simply repeating this cycle</font></font></font></font>

240
00:21:53,750 --> 00:21:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kurikaeshi boku wa ikite iru</font></font></font></font>

241
00:22:01,840 --> 00:22:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">held in my two hands</font></font></font></font>

242
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:08,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono ryoute ni kakaete iru mono</font></font></font></font>

243
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:11,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a droplet of time</font></font></font></font>

244
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:11,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">toki no shizuku</font></font></font></font>

245
00:22:12,760 --> 00:22:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">softly clutching forgotten memories</font></font></font></font>

246
00:22:12,810 --> 00:22:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">sotto nigirishimete wasureta kioku</font></font></font></font>

247
00:22:19,100 --> 00:22:22,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">lost words</font></font></font></font>

248
00:22:19,150 --> 00:22:22,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">nakushita kotoba</font></font></font></font>

249
00:22:30,870 --> 00:22:34,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I'll keep these thoughts...</font></font></font></font>

250
00:22:30,910 --> 00:22:34,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono omoi wa</font></font></font></font>

251
00:22:40,580 --> 00:22:42,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Don't you talk stupid like that!</font>

252
00:22:43,040 --> 00:22:46,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I don't care what
you're thinking anymore!</font>

253
00:22:47,050 --> 00:22:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I won't let you go to Orochimaru's
place no matter what!</font>

254
00:22:50,050 --> 00:22:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm taking you back to the village
even if I have to drag you there!</font>

255
00:22:55,370 --> 00:22:58,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Sasuke! You're my...</font>

256
00:22:58,770 --> 00:23:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Tearfull Yell! You Are My Friend."</font>

